  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "How devices communicate",
      "items": [
        "An enrollment profile points the device to /mdm for check-in and command requests. SCEP or ACME issues the device identity certificate.",
        "This server carries declarative management requests inside MDM check-in messages. APNs prompts a connection; it does not deliver MDM commands."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "What the server manages",
      "items": [
        "The shared runtime serves HTTP or native TLS and supervises background workers. Roles select the mounted services.",
        "The admin API manages commands, declarations, enrollment profiles, controlled replacement, and separate app push credentials.",
        "The MDM service and declarative engine share persistent enrollment and feature stores; the overview shows selected control paths."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Read next",
      "items": [
        "Follow the enrollment diagrams for discovery and trust, the command flow for device requests, and the companion diagrams for replacement, app notifications, and the test bench."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
